meta {
  name: ecollect
}

docs {
  The bank's eCollect callbacks for virtual accounts (`onboarding/controller/VirtualAccountNotificationResource.java`).
  These are how money comes into a VAHN wallet. Razorpay's own webhooks don't do this: `/webhook/v1/razorpay/payment`
  is for FASTag recharges and `/webhook/v1/razorpay/payout` is for money going out.

  Auth is a static bearer token from `virtualAccountValidation.validBearerTokens` in plutus-java `config.yml`, not a
  user token. Put it in the gitignored `.env` next to `bruno.json` as `PLUTUS_API_ECOLLECT_BEARER_TOKEN`.

  Responses aren't wrapped in the usual `{success, data}` envelope.
}
